  "notes": "COMPONENTS:\n{離|り} (leave; separate) + {陸|りく} (land)\nLiterally: \"leaving the land\"\n\nFLIGHT PHASES:\n1. {離陸|りりく}: takeoff\n2. ⟦{上昇|じょうしょう}→上昇：11296_joushou⟧: climb\n3. ⟦{巡航|じゅんこう}→巡航：noentry⟧: cruise\n4. ⟦{降下|こうか}→降下：noentry⟧: descent\n5. ⟦{着陸|ちゃくりく}→着陸：05982_chakuriku⟧: landing\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- ⟦{離陸速度|りりくそくど}→離陸速度：noentry⟧: takeoff speed\n- ⟦{離陸重量|りりくじゅうりょう}→離陸重量：noentry⟧: takeoff weight\n- ⟦{垂直|すいちょく}→垂直：05446_suichoku⟧{離陸|りりく} (垂直離陸): vertical takeoff\n\nANNOUNCEMENTS:\nAirline announcements: 「⟦まもなく→まもなく：02491_mamonaku⟧{離陸|りりく}⟦いたします→いたす：01314_itasu⟧」(We will be taking off shortly)",
